# Normalise line endings. core.autocrlf was true with no .gitattributes, so
# files were LF when written and CRLF after git touched them, and biome (which
# expects LF) flagged whichever files git had most recently checked out. The
# lint count swung between 26 and 38 for that reason alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit so no binary can be mangled by text detection.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
